  "body": "**What.** Run the Borel-Pade zero tracking on the seven new frequency nodes and decide whether the second zero of S1 becomes real near omega/omega_inf 1.10.\n\n**Why.** Digest, item 2a. The criterion was fixed on 2026-11-07 16:37 UTC in [comms.txt](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms.txt) before the data.\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- Planted truth first: a planted crossing at 1.095 is recovered and one moved to 1.15 is rejected, through the same code (`plant_x1.py`, `second_zero.py`).\n- The zero is called real only if Im x1 changes sign between two nodes in every ring-free Borel-Pade sum.\n- The result and its status word go into [notes/HARMONY.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/notes/HARMONY.md) item 1. A pass goes to Nathan as a decision on next steps, not into the README.\n\n**Depends on.** Finish T155: S1 coefficients at omega/omega_inf 1.06, 1.09, 1.11, 1.14; Finish T153: S1 coefficients at omega/omega_inf 1.08, 1.10, 1.12\n\n**Files.** [solver/harmony/stokes/second_zero.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/solver/harmony/stokes/second_zero.py), [solver/harmony/stokes/plant_x1.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/solver/harmony/stokes/plant_x1.py), [solver/harmony/stokes/zerolib.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/solver/harmony/stokes/zerolib.py), [notes/HARMONY.md](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/notes/HARMONY.md)",
